Package: unsure
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Calculator for numbers with uncertainty
 The Unsure Calculator allows you to perform calculations with uncertain 
 numbers using a simple probabilistic notation. Use the ~ operator to 
 specify ranges (e.g., "4~6 * 2~3") and get statistical results including 
 histograms and confidence intervals.
 .
 This package provides a command-line tool for performing calculations
 with uncertain inputs and getting probabilistic results. 